  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者ら三人合わせて――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The three of us together are—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』です！\nよろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cutie☆AnimaL! Thank you for having us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Group"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』です。\nよろしくお願いします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cutie☆AnimaL! Thank you for having us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』です！\nよろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cutie☆AnimaL! Thank you for having us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者らのこと、初めて見るよって方が多いと\n思いますので、自己紹介させていただきまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I imagine many of you are seeing us for the first time, so allow us to introduce ourselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コンコン！\u3000貴殿の心にお邪魔しまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Knock knock! Permit me to enter your heart!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いらっしゃーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いらっしゃーい……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "C-come on in...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キツネの鬼門にございます！\u3000以後、よしなに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm Kimon the fox! Pleased to make your acquaintance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティム。もっと大きな声を出さないと、\n彼女たちに届かないぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim, you need to speak up louder or they won't hear you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……でも、やっぱりまだちょっと恥ずかしいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... but I'm still a little embarrassed..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく。見ていろティム。こうやるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly. Watch me, Tim. This is how you do it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "絶対一番、ナンバーワン！\u3000ハムスターのヨハナよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Always number one! I'm Johanna the hamster."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっ！\u3000一番星！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Our brightest star!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっ！\u3000一番星ぃいいい！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Our brightest star!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "！\u3000……ネズミじゃないから、覚えておいて。よろしく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "! ...I'm not a mouse, so remember that. Nice to meet you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "彼女たちだって頑張ってあそこに立って、\n大声を出しているんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're up there working hard, raising their voices for us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当たり前のようにやっているように見えるが、\n俺たちと変わらない一人の人間",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They might make it look easy, but they're just like us—human beings trying their best."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張っている子を応援することの、何が恥ずかしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's there to be embarrassed about when cheering someone on who's giving it their all?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000そ、そうだね……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Y-you're right...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
