  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ～！\u3000すっごく楽しかったー！\nライブからしか得られない栄養素が確実にある……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was so much fun! There are nutrients you can only get from a live performance...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次のライブ、いつかな？\nもっとコールを覚えて、盛り上げるんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder when the next live is? I need to learn more calls so I can really hype things up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "オタク弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Otaku Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。また次のライブも必ず来よう。\nこの調子なら、きっとすぐ大きい箱になるだろうな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. We'll definitely come to the next one too. At this rate, they'll be playing bigger venues in no time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "オタク兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Otaku Older Brother"
        }
